@startuml diagrama-cloud
' ============================================================================
' Diagrama de deploy em cloud pública (AWS) — proposta
' Renderize localmente (VS Code + PlantUML) ou use o servidor PlantUML.
' ============================================================================
title Deploy em Cloud (AWS) — API de Consulta de Saldo

actor Cliente as "Cliente\n(aplicativo móvel/web)"
actor Autorizador as "Autorizador de\ntransações (sistema externo)"

package "AWS Cloud" {
  package "Camada de entrada" {
    [API Gateway] as AG
    [WAF] as WAF
  }

  package "Camada de aplicação (VPC)" {
    [Application Load Balancer] as ALB
    [ECS Fargate - api (réplicas)] as ECS_API
    [ECS Fargate - ingestor (réplicas)] as ECS_ING
  }

  package "Camada de dados" {
    database "RDS PostgreSQL\n(Multi-AZ)" as RDS
    [ElastiCache Redis\n(cache opcional)] as REDIS
  }

  package "Messaging" {
    queue "SQS\ntransacoes-financeiras-processadas" as SQS
    queue "DLQ\ntransacoes-financeiras-processadas-dlq" as DLQ
  }

  package "Observabilidade" {
    [CloudWatch\n(logs, métricas, alarmes)] as CW
    [Prometheus + Grafana] as PRM
    [S3\n(artefatos, backups)] as S3
  }
}

Cliente --> AG : HTTPS
AG --> WAF
WAF --> ALB
ALB --> ECS_API : health checks /actuator/health

Autorizador --> SQS : publica transações
SQS --> ECS_ING : long polling (batch 10)
SQS --> DLQ : RedrivePolicy (maxReceiveCount=5)
ECS_ING --> RDS : upsert atômico (last-write-wins)
ECS_API --> RDS : leitura por PK
ECS_API --> REDIS : cache de saldo (opcional)

ECS_API --> CW : logs/métricas
ECS_ING --> CW : logs/métricas
CW --> PRM : scrape
ECS_API --> S3 : backups (RDS) / artefatos
ECS_ING --> S3

legend right
  **Estratégia de deploy:** Blue/Green via CodeDeploy
  **Rollback:** automático se health checks falharem
  **Escala:** ECS Service Auto Scaling por métricas (CPU/mensagens na fila)
endlegend

@enduml
